{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/b72325689692c8478badf80009ea194a.avif?t=1768831537\" width=1500 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and race against your opponent in a dungeon made to play and feel like a board game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain levels, earn coins, use skills, pick up, buy or sell items and find events. Goblins, Kobolds and other horny foes may stand in your way... Will you knock them down or seduce them?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/adac3a0afc6c483ce9ba13570a3f7422.avif?t=1768831537\" width=1500 height=792 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each strategic choice you make will build towards Top (dominance) or Bottom (submission) points, shaping how you interact with the dungeon and its denizens\u2026 as well as your own opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/ca6b290e3a0accc176389172254473c7.avif?t=1768831537\" width=1500 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick who you want to play as : enemies' genders and events will adapt to your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mage, Findrel can absorb mana from defeated foes and cast his wind magic to move further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/c62accde3a5a7b4be92b9fe496960525.poster.avif?t=1768831537\" width=1170 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/c62accde3a5a7b4be92b9fe496960525.webm?t=1768831537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a warrior, Layla can face adversaries stronger than her and play an extra turn after encounters..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both can be played as either dominant or submissive, offering different perspectives and dynamics for each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking specific achievements will also show parts of their character sheets, unveiling more of their backstory, traits and quirks as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/063a3befeb442544322c31a4cbde530f.avif?t=1768831537\" width=1500 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game Master running your Dungeons &amp; Turn-ons campaign invited you and your friend to play your beloved characters in Tabletops &amp; Bottoms, a board game of their own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step of your sexy adventure is narrated in a diegetic way. Whether you play against an AI opponent or another human in local multiplayer, watch the player characters react and interact with each other during the game\u2026 or disable it altogether to stay immersed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/79273ed49be54da902bcec22e824f8af.poster.avif?t=1768831537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/79273ed49be54da902bcec22e824f8af.webm?t=1768831537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/79273ed49be54da902bcec22e824f8af.mp4?t=1768831537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From one event to the next, discover a rich and promiscuous fantasy world, one filled to the brim with magic, sweat and cyprine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway, are you a Top or a Bottom ?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973280?t=1768831537","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/346b4909ff398fbb0aeaaf2b4ecd00232b69430b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768831537","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/62c16ace4b18e00eee56c8527eb8b0d85bda846a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768831537","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/62c16ace4b18e00eee56c8527eb8b0d85bda846a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768831537","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Every sexual encounter with foes are consensual and initiated by the player.\r\nScenes involving both main characters are triggered when one of them earns enough Top or Bottom points, showing the current dynamic between them.\r\nThe game also depicts alcohol drinking, as well as the use of aphrodisiacs."},"demos":[{"appid":4169910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/b72325689692c8478badf80009ea194a