 can face adversaries stronger than her and play an extra turn after encounters..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both can be played as either dominant or submissive, offering different perspectives and dynamics for each playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking specific achievements will also show parts of their character sheets, unveiling more of their backstory, traits and quirks as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/063a3befeb442544322c31a4cbde530f.avif?t=1768831537\" width=1500 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Game Master running your Dungeons &amp; Turn-ons campaign invited you and your friend to play your beloved characters in Tabletops &amp; Bottoms, a board game of their own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step of your sexy adventure is narrated in a diegetic way. Whether you play against an AI opponent or another human in local multiplayer, watch the player characters react and interact with each other during the game\u2026 or disable it altogether to stay immersed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/79273ed49be54da902bcec22e824f8af.poster.avif?t=1768831537\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/79273ed49be54da902bcec22e824f8af.webm?t=1768831537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/extras/79273ed49be54da902bcec22e824f8af.mp4?t=1768831537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From one event to the next, discover a rich and promiscuous fantasy world, one filled to the brim with magic, sweat and cyprine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyway, are you a Top or a Bottom ?</p>","developers":["PopotoProductions"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/8eeeca13ba0e581ee3cc66ff90916af1de9999af/header.jpg?t=1768831537","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Tabletops & Bottoms","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["PopotoProductions"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Nudez\nLinguagem impr\u00c3\u00b3pria\nViol\u00c3\u00aancia","rating":"18","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"18","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"1","descriptors":"Sexuelle Inhalte\nGewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak","rating":"BANNED","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"2147483647","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q2 2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/00dc002bcc40222b4f82ce51e0ac92ce31606509/ss_00dc002bcc40222b4f82ce51e0ac92ce31606509.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768831537","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973280/00dc002bcc40222b4f82ce51e0ac92ce31606509/ss_00dc002bcc40222b4f82ce51e0ac92ce31606